msgid ""
"Apply updates Security Headers and Security Features only. Content Security "
"Policy is never changed by a profile."
msgstr ""
"اعمال پروفایل فقط Security Headers و Security Features را به‌روز می‌کند. "
"Content Security Policy هرگز با پروفایل تغییر نمی‌کند."

